# Latch currently requires no environment variables for its deterministic browser demo.
# Keep this file comments-only until a verified core handoff introduces a public runtime setting that the application actually reads.
# Every future VITE_* value will be visible to users and must contain public configuration only.
# Never add API keys, credentials, seed phrases, signing keys, witnesses, private policies, wallet secrets, or other sensitive values.

# Reserved names for a future verified handoff. The current application does not read them.
# Keep them commented and unset until their behavior and public status are verified.
# VITE_LATCH_DEFAULT_MODE=demo
# VITE_MIDNIGHT_NETWORK=preprod
# VITE_MOAT_CONTRACT_ADDRESS=       # [CORE FACT REQUIRED]: verified deployment address
# VITE_ZK_ASSET_BASE_URL=           # [CORE FACT REQUIRED]: verified public asset host
